msgstr "Lehetnek teljesen eltérő megjelenésűek a fordításaim?"

#. translators: Answer in the questions and answers of the Translation
#. Management settings. %1$s: the opening tag of a link to a page on wpml.org,
#. %2$s: its closing tag.
#: menu/wpml-tm-menus-settings.php:326
#, php-format
